@startuml US085_SSD
title US085 - Test Flight Plan - SSD

actor "Pilot" as Pilot
participant "SEM4PI System" as System

Pilot -> System : request to test/validate a flight plan
System --> Pilot : show draft flight plans

Pilot -> System : select flight plan

alt DSL validation or persistence check fails
    System --> Pilot : display errors and set status REJECTED
else C flight test fails
    System --> Pilot : display C test report and set status REJECTED
else all checks pass
    System --> Pilot : display success and set status VALIDATED
end

@enduml
